{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>BLOOD=BULLETS</strong> is a bullet hell boss rush action platformer where you dash into bullets to refill ammo. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In order to kill the blood itself, one must hack into the sequence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3271270/extras/unique.gif?t=1729452007\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Instead of avoiding bullets at all cost - dash yourself through as many, to refill your ammo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3271270/extras/dash.gif?t=1729452007\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3271270/extras/fast.gif?t=1729452007\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this Demo, dash and shoot your way through 2 out of 6 unique challenging bosses with ultra responsive and fast controls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3271270/extras/battle.gif?t=1729452007\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3271270/extras/blood.gif?t=1729452007\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Start hacking into the main cortex of the blood matrix, followed by stylish 1-bit  pixel art and\u00a0retro soundtrack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3271270/extras/hacking2.gif?t=1729452007\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","a